The ANGEL-F5 probe has gyroscope sensors showing us its attitude.

Enable the telemetry data line 0 to see the attitude telemetry.

Hint: to open the data line, use the recently unlocked OBUS instruction.
Do not forget to place 0 on the stack before that to indicate the number
of the data line to enable.
------------------------------------------------------------------------
00
OBUS    -- enable data line 0

